<title>UK: Morgan Stanley set warrants on the MIB-30 index.</title>
<headline>Morgan Stanley set warrants on the MIB-30 index.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Morgan Stanley (Jersey) has issued 50 million American-style call and put warrants, in five equal tranches, on the MIB-30 index, lead manager Morgan Stanley &amp; Co International said.</p>
<p>COMMON TERMS:</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	19.SEP.97		 PAYDATE	10.OCT.96</p>
<p> LISTING	   LUXEMBOURG		MIN EXER LOT 1000</p>
<p>INDEX REFERENCE 14000</p>
<p>* * * * * * * *</p>
<p> WARRANT     STRIKE	    ISSUE	 PREMIUM    GEARING</p>
<p> PUT A	 13000	     479 ITL     11.11 PCT  29.23 X</p>
<p> CALL B	14000	     1467 ITL    10.48 PCT   9.54 X</p>
<p> PUT  C	14000	     829 ITL	5.92 PCT  16.89 X</p>
<p> CALL D	15000	     975 ITL     14.11 PCT  14.36 X</p>
<p> CALL E	16000	     637 ITL     18.84 PCT  21.97 X</p>
<p>-- Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
